"gloss":"move"},{"text":"தர","lemma":"தர","gloss":"to give/bring"}],"gloss":"as it recedes"},{"surface":"பெயர்தந்து","parts":[{"text":"பெயர்","lemma":"பெயர்","gloss":"move"},{"text":"தந்து","lemma":"தந்து","gloss":"having given"}],"gloss":"moving back and forth"},{"surface":"ஆங்கு","parts":[{"text":"ஆங்கு","lemma":"ஆங்கு","gloss":"like"}],"gloss":"like"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"வருந்தும்","parts":[{"text":"வருந்து","lemma":"வருந்து","gloss":"suffer"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"உம்","gloss":"adjectival participle"}],"gloss":"suffers"},{"surface":"தோழி","parts":[{"text":"தோழி","lemma":"தோழி","gloss":"friend"}],"gloss":"O friend!"},{"surface":"அவர்","parts":[{"text":"அவர்","lemma":"அவர்","gloss":"he"}],"gloss":"he"},{"surface":"இருந்த","parts":[{"text":"இரு","lemma":"இரு","gloss":"stay/reside"},{"text":"ந்த","lemma":"ந்த","gloss":"past adjectival participle"}],"gloss":"where he resided"},{"surface":"என்","parts":[{"text":"என்","lemma":"என்","gloss":"my"}],"gloss":"my"},{"surface":"நெஞ்சே","parts":[{"text":"நெஞ்சு","lemma":"நெஞ்சு","gloss":"heart"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"emphasis"}],"gloss":"heart indeed"}]}],"literal":"When desire exceeds limits, thinking of the lover, / if we lament for him, being with us, / without settling on one side, in between, / like the blossom-covered mangrove tree standing in the expanse, / swaying on the side of the shifting backwater as the tide / recedes and advances, / suffers, O friend, my heart where he resided!","translation":"When desire exceeds all bounds and reaches out to my lover, my heart, where he once resided, cannot settle on either side, O friend! Like a blossom-covered mangrove tree standing in the wide backwaters, swaying back and forth as the tides recede and advance, my heart is tossed in distress.","modern":"தோழியே! காமம் எல்லை கடந்து காதலனை நினைத்து, நாம் அவருக்காக வருந்தும்போது, என் நெஞ்சம் நம்மோடு இருந்து ஒரு பக்கமும் சாராமல் நடுவில் தவிக்கிறது. உப்பங்கழியின் பரப்பில் பூக்கள் நிறைந்த தாழை மரம், அலைகள் உள்வாங்கி மீண்டும் வரும்போது அலைக்கழிக்கப்பட்டு வளைந்து ஆடுவதைப் போல, அவர் தங்கியிருந்த என் நெஞ்சம் அலைபாய்ந்து வருந்துகிறது.","explanation":"The heroine is speaking to her close friend about her intense suffering during the hero's absence. Her heart is caught in a painful conflict: it wants to go to her lover out of deep desire, yet it must remain with her due to her physical constraints and sense of modesty. She compares her restless heart to a mangrove tree growing in the coastal backwaters. Just as the tree is constantly swayed back and forth by the incoming and outgoing tides, her heart is tossed between hope and despair, unable to find peace on either side. This vivid imagery of the coastal landscape perfectly captures the heroine's state of anxious waiting and emotional instability.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.6],[0.6,1.0],[1.0,1.5],[1.5,2.0],[2.0,2.3],[2.3,2.6],[2.6,3.27],[3.33,3.6],[3.6,4.6],[4.6,5.1],[5.1,5.4],[5.4,5.83],[5.83,6.22],[6.22,6.9],[6.9,7.2],[7.3,8.06],[8.06,8.25],[8.25,8.25],[8.25,8.44],[8.44,9.2],[9.2,11.1],[11.1,11.1],[11.1,11.1],[11.1,12.7],[12.7,13.15],[13.15,13.9],[13.9,14.2]],"female":[[0.0,0.7],[0.7,1.1],[1.1,1.7],[1.7,2.2],[2.2,3.1],[3.1,3.6],[3.73,4.1],[4.2,4.6],[4.6,5.8],[5.8,6.3],[6.3,6.75],[6.75,6.9],[6.9,6.93],[6.93,7.0],[7.0,7.0],[7.0,7.0],[7.0,10.8],[10.8,11.55],[11.55,11.55],[11.55,12.3],[12.3,13.14],[13.14,13.5],[13.5,14.0],[14.0,15.2],[15.2,15.63],[15.89,16.6],[16.6,17.1]]}}